<title>USA: PHLX plans GelTex, Larscom options.</title>
<headline>PHLX plans GelTex, Larscom options.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said it will list options on shares of GelTex Pharmaceuticals Inc and Larscom Inc on April 22.</p>
<p>GelTex options will have initial strike prices of 17-1/2, 20 and 22-1/2 with expirations in May, June, July and October. Gateway Partners will be the specialist on the PHLX floor.</p>
<p>The Larscom options will open with strike prices of 5, 7-1/2 and 10 and expirations in May, June, September and December. Group One Ltd will be the specialist.</p>
<p>Position limits are 4,500 contracts for both GelTex and Larscom options, the exchange said.</p>
<p>Chicago Derivatives Desk ((312-408-8750))</p>
